  "releaseNotes": "* Potential performance improvements in some Span and Memory extensions\n* Added ``AsSpan<T>`` and ``AsMemory<T>`` extensions for ``ReadOnlySpan<T>`` and ``ReadOnlyMemory<T>`` respectively\n* Added Memory Sort extensions for ``ReadOnlySpan<T>`` and ``ReadOnlyMemory<T>``\n* Added ``ToList`` extensions for ``ReadOnlySpan<T>`` and ``ReadOnlyMemory<T>``\n* Added Span<char>, Span<string>, ReadOnlySpan<char>, ReadOnlySpan<string>, Memory<char>, Memory<string>, ReadOnlyMemory<char>, and ReadOnlyMemory<string> ``IsWhiteSpace`` extension block methods",
